  "raw": {
    "https://jobs.mdx.ac.uk/Registration/": {
      "title": "Registration",
      "description": "Registration - Careers at Middlesex University Skip to main content Home Login Register Jobs Home Current Vacancies How to Apply Contact Us FAQ Terms of Use Contact Us Cookies Accessibility This site requires the use of cookies as defined by our Terms and Conditions . \n        We have provided a detailed description of how cookies work and are used on the site . \n        To accept cookies, please click the \"Accept Cookies\" button. Accept Cookies Home Login Register More ▼ Home Login Register Careers at MDX Careers at Middlesex Jobs Home Current Vacancies How to Apply Contact Us FAQ More ▼ Registration If you have not previously registered to make an online application for a vacancy simply follow the registration details below after which you will be able to make and submit your application. If you have previously registered you should login using the details you created when registering rather than creating a new account. By entering any personal details below, you consent to us storing and processing those details in accordance with our Terms of Use. Details * denotes a compulsory field Title * Mr Mrs Miss Ms Dr Prof Canon Dame Lady Lord Mjr Mx Rabbi Rev Sir Forenames * Surname * Email address * Confirm Email address * Password must be a minimum of 10 characters, and must contain 3 of the following: upper case letter, lower case letter, numerical digit, any other character. Please remember that passwords are case-sensitive and spaces are not allowed. Password * Confirm Password * Verification Terms & conditions I have read and accept the terms & conditions . Register Find Jobs Jobs by Email Jobs by RSS Search Jobs Search Advanced Job Search Useful Links Careers at Middlesex About Us MU Services Limited Existing Account / Staff Member Do you have an existing account, or are you a member of staff? Login New User For new applicants, please register for an account Register Latest Vacancies Library Experience Assistant x2 Placement and Work Experience Consultant Placement and Work Experience Team Leader View All Vacancies Terms of Use | Contact Us | Cookies | Accessibility"
    },
    "https://jobs.mdx.ac.uk/display.aspx?id=1253&pid=0&tabId=230": {
      "title": "How to Apply - Careers at Middlesex University",
      "description": "How to Apply - Careers at Middlesex University Skip to main content Home Login Register Jobs Home Current Vacancies How to Apply Contact Us FAQ Terms of Use Contact Us Cookies Accessibility This site requires the use of cookies as defined by our Terms and Conditions . \n        We have provided a detailed description of how cookies work and are used on the site . \n        To accept cookies, please click the \"Accept Cookies\" button. Accept Cookies Home Login Register More ▼ Home Login Register Careers at MDX Careers at Middlesex Jobs Home Current Vacancies How to Apply Contact Us FAQ More ▼ How to Apply Finding Vacancies Our current vacancies are listed on this website and can be viewed by the type of role, e.g. Academic, campus location, full-time/part-time and if you wish to see all current vacancies, you can select the option to view them all. How To Apply If you are interested in a post, click the Apply Online button within the job advert and you’ll be asked to register and set up an account on the site ( Why do I have to register? ) or log into the account you’ve already created. Be sure to provide an email address you use regularly, because that’s how we’ll keep in touch with you about your application. If you require the application form in an alternative format e.g. large print; audio etc. please email HR on HRSS@mdx.ac.uk. All applications must be submitted online by 23:59 pm on the closing date. Access our guidance on how to complete your application form and prepare for interview. Immigration Points Based System For more information on the new immigration points based system and Global talent routes please go to our Home Page and under Work for Us we have information and links to the Governments Websites that can help you. You can check your eligibility for a role if you require a visa by going to Check if you need a UK visa - GOV.UK You will need to use the appropriate SOC code for the role, this can be obtained by contacting HRSS@mdx.ac.uk and giving them the job reference for the job you are applying for. Applicants must also be able to speak, read, write and understand English. You’ll usually need to prove your knowledge of English when you apply. Application Form The online application form can be completed in stages and you can login/logout at any time. The form automatically saves as you enter your information and it is simple to move backwards and forwards within the form at any time prior to submission. Help is available at each stage to guide you through the form. Before final submission, you can preview your application and can then choose to refine or submit the form. After Applying Once you have submitted your application, you will see in the 'My Applications' area, that the status of your application will be \"submitted\" and it will also show the date of submission. The following day, you will receive an acknowledgment email if not, please ensure that you check your Spam. After Closing Date The selection panel will assess all applicants against the requirements of the job description and person specification and then notify the applicants as appropriate. Find Jobs Jobs by Email Jobs by RSS Search Jobs Search Advanced Job Search Useful Links Careers at Middlesex About Us MU Services Limited Existing Account / Staff Member Do you have an existing account, or are you a member of staff? Login New User For new applicants, please register for an account Register Latest Vacancies Library Experience Assistant x2 Placement and Work Experience Consultant Placement and Work Experience Team Leader View All Vacancies Terms of Use | Contact Us | Cookies | Accessibility"
    },
    "https://jobs.mdx.ac.uk/display.aspx?id=1354&pid=0&tabId=230": {
      "title": "Contact Us - Careers at Middlesex University",
      "description": "Contact Us - Careers at Middlesex University Skip to main content Home Login Register Jobs Home Current Vacancies How to Apply Contact Us FAQ Terms of Use Contact Us Cookies Accessibility This site requires the use of cookies as defined by our Terms and Conditions . \n        We have provided a detailed description of how cookies work and are used on the site . \n        To accept cookies, please click the \"Accept Cookies\" button. Accept Cookies Home Login Register More ▼ Home Login Register Careers at MDX Careers at Middlesex Jobs Home Current Vacancies How to Apply Contact Us FAQ More ▼ Contact Us For general enquiries please contact us at: Human Resources Middlesex University HRSS@mdx.ac.uk Find Jobs Jobs by Email Jobs by RSS Search Jobs Search Advanced Job Search Useful Links Careers at Middlesex About Us MU Services Limited Existing Account / Staff Member Do you have an existing account, or are you a member of staff? Login New User For new applicants, please register for an account Register Latest Vacancies Library Experience Assistant x2 Placement and Work Experience Consultant Placement and Work Experience Team Leader View All Vacancies Terms of Use | Contact Us | Cookies | Accessibility"
